,"surface":"田蚡","kind":"person","person_id":"aax_0zm_3jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0133","start":133,"end":137,"surface":"文學儒者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0142","start":142,"end":145,"surface":"公孫弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"o7s_89o_zka","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m005-0162","start":162,"end":167,"surface":"天下之學士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin","book_id":"b-shiji-121","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji121-rulin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p014","text":"伏生者，濟南人也。故為秦博士。孝文帝時，欲求能治尚書者，天下無有，乃聞伏生能治，欲召之。是時伏生年九十餘，老，不能行，於是乃詔太常使掌故晁錯往受之。秦時焚書，伏生壁藏之。其後兵大起，流亡，漢定，伏生求其書，亡數十篇，獨得二十九篇，即以教于齊魯之閒。學者由是頗能言尚書，諸山東大師無不涉尚書以教矣。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"伏生","kind":"person","person_id":"t6q_oe6_hom","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m014-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"vz8_68e_j99","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m014-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"伏生","kind":"person","person_id":"t6q_oe6_hom","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m014-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"伏生","kind":"person","person_id":"t6q_oe6_hom","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m014-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"晁錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m014-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"伏生","kind":"person","person_id":"t6q_oe6_hom","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m014-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"伏生","kind":"person","person_id":"t6q_oe6_hom","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m014-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"學者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m014-0134","start":134,"end":139,"surface":"諸山東大師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin","book_id":"b-shiji-121","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji121-rulin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p015","text":"伏生教濟南張生及歐陽生，歐陽生教千乘兒寬。兒寬既通尚書，以文學應郡舉，詣博士受業，受業孔安國。兒寬貧無資用，常為弟子都養，及時時閒行傭賃，以給衣食。行常帶經，止息則誦習之。以試第次，補廷尉史。是時張湯方鄉學，以為奏讞掾，以古法議決疑大獄，而愛幸寬。寬為人溫良，有廉智，自持，而善著書、書奏，敏於文，口不能發明也。湯以為長者，數稱譽之。及湯為御史大夫，以兒寬為掾，薦之天子。天子見問，說之。張湯死后六年，兒寬位至御史大夫。九年而以官卒。寬在三公位，以和良承意從容得久，然無有所匡諫；於官，官屬易之，不為盡力。張生亦為博士。而伏生孫以治尚書徵，不能明也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"伏生","kind":"person","person_id":"t6q_oe6_hom","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"張生","kind":"person","person_id":"aqd_hcr_hzk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"歐陽生","kind":"person","person_id":"47o_xhl_8u1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"歐陽生","kind":"person","person_id":"47o_xhl_8u1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"孔安國","kind":"person","person_id":"9dt_8rh_m9a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m015-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","